# Preview / modelDev identity placeholders

When no real card has been selected (Klai builder, `modelDev`, empty Customize/Proof/Cart preview, CardPreview fallbacks), show **generic placeholders only**. Do not use real-looking personal names, job titles, offices, or emails.

## Required placeholders

| Field | English | French |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Name | `Firstname Lastname` | `Prénom Nom` |
| Title / region / team | `Title` (region omitted until filled) / `Specialized team` | `Titre` / `Équipe spécialisée` |
| Email | `first.lastname@colliersprojectleaders.com` | `prenom.nom@colliersprojectleaders.com` |
| Phone | `+1 555 555 5555` (or `555 555 5555`) | same |
| Address | `Address name` / `Unit, Street` / … | `Nom de l'adresse` / … |

## How to seed `modelDev`

- Prefer **empty** card/proof fields (`name: ""`, `title: ""`, …) so the UI falls back to `SAMPLE_CARD` / CU-07 placeholders.
- If a filled name is required for the page to render, use **`Firstname Lastname`** only — never Hannah, Alex, Carlos, Sarah, or other person names.
- Do **not** fill realistic titles, degrees, regions, teams, or real office streets in preview/dev data.
- Same for cart line `details` on Shipping / Review / Confirmed / CartDrawer sample data.

## Exceptions (allowed)

- **Print PDF layout fixtures** (`src/helpers/approvalSamples.js`, `docs/samples/print-pdf/short-long-examples.json`, approval PNGs) may keep Standard/Maximum stress names for geometry lock only.
- Do not copy those fixture names into Klai `modelDev` or live preview empty states.
